      "pageIntroText": "iSocrateez provides personalized AI-generated ethical advice. Describe a dilemma, choose the ethical perspective you want to bring to it, and get advice with an explanation of the reasoning behind it.\n\n[center]Try [link https://millxing.github.io/iSocrateez/]iSocrateez[/link][br]password: [code]stickytoffeepudding[/code][/center]",
