          "type": "text",
          "delay": "delay-2",
          "heading": "Set your ethical profile",
          "text": "There are three ways to customize the perspective behind the advice:\n\n- Answer nine questions that map your ethical profile along three axes.\n- Set your coordinates on those axes directly.\n- Choose from 40 philosophers and ethical traditions to find a perspective close to your own.\n\nThe three axes describe the relative importance you give to [b]outcomes versus principles[/b], [b]the individual versus the collective[/b], and [b]reason versus intuition[/b].",
